'''R1-G4'''<ref name="SWVE" /> was an [[R1-series astromech droid]] produced by [[Industrial Automaton]]<ref name="BMF 28" /> at some point prior to the [[Battle of Yavin]]. The [[astromech droid]] was one of the [[droid]]s displayed by [[Jawa]] traders to the [[Lars homestead|Lars moisture farm]] when [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[stormtrooper]]s arrived on [[Tatooine]] looking for the escaped [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] droids [[R2-D2]] and [[C-3PO]].<ref name="ANH" />

